```
id: SPL-024
name: Kerberoasting: many RC4 service tickets
description: One client requests RC4 service tickets for many distinct service names.
platform: Splunk
mitre_tactic: Credential Access
mitre_technique: T1558.003 Steal or Forge Kerberos Tickets: Kerberoasting
severity: High
data_source: index=wineventlog (Security)
false_positives: Legacy applications that support only RC4; scanners.
tuning: Exclude known legacy services; enforce AES on service accounts.
test_method: Request service tickets for several SPNs in a lab domain.
owner: <OWNER>
status: Draft
last_review: 2026-11-19
```
index=wineventlog sourcetype="WinEventLog:Security" EventCode=4769 Ticket_Encryption_Type="0x17" earliest=-1h
| where NOT match(Service_Name,"\$$") AND lower(Service_Name)!="krbtgt"
| stats count AS tickets dc(Service_Name) AS distinct_services values(Service_Name) AS services BY Account_Name, Client_Address
| where distinct_services>=5
| sort - distinct_services
